Data licence — data-cached releases
===================================

The MIT licence in LICENSE covers the code in this repository. It does not
cover the data published in this repository's releases, and no licence is
granted over that data.

The cached-data JSON published here is an internal build artifact. It exists to
feed clusterflick.com and the rest of the Clusterflick pipeline. It is
published here because the pipeline runs in the open, not as a dataset offered
for reuse.

It is film metadata retrieved from The Movie Database — synopses, cast and
crew, release dates, poster paths, collections, genres and trailer ids. Almost
none of it is Clusterflick's own work. It belongs to TMDB and is used under the
TMDB API terms of use (https://www.themoviedb.org/api-terms-of-use), which do
not permit Clusterflick to sublicense it to anyone else. If you want this
metadata, get it from TMDB under your own API terms.

Where TMDB material is shown, follow TMDB's own attribution requirements —
they are theirs to set, not ours to restate:

    https://www.themoviedb.org/api-terms-of-use#:~:text=3.%20Attribution

